    "description": {
      "value": "Crafted from black iron, this crude suit of +2 resilient full plate is designed to make you look like a horned demon, with your face peering out of the screaming maw of the beast.\n\nWhile wearing the armor, you can attack with the helmet's horns. They are a martial melee weapon with the effects of a +2 weapon potency rune. They deal 2d8 piercing damage and have the deadly trait. On a critical hit with the horns, the target must attempt a DC 30 Fortitude save against the Abyssal plague disease (page 316). The horns can't be etched with any runes.\n\nIf you aren't evil, you're drained 2 and can't recover from this condition while wearing demon armor.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Frequency once per day\nYou cast dimension door."
    },
